 as  she continues to improve before our very  eyes at this point we see that mitsuri  has awakened her demon slayer mark an  especially cute one around her neck and  if you didn't know demon stare marks are  like going super saiyan for demon  slayers it increases all of their  abilities including speed strength and  so on demonstrator mark mitsuri is good  enough to anger the hatred clone because  she's too good and as a result he can't  send a beast after tanjiro nezuko and  genya his only consolation is that he  believes since she's a human she'll have  to run out of strength eventually and  that's when he'll beat her eventually  we're told on a cover page that mitsuri  has been using a lot of big moves so her  strength won't last much longer meaning  that if tanjiro kenya and nezuko weren't  going after the real body she would lose  eventually against upper moon 4. however  you're usually not expected to beat an  upper moon alone except if you're  muichiro and it's upper moon 5. so the  fact that she is able to do this well  speaks volumes about her strength tundra  succeeds in destroying the original body  and we find out that nezuko can survive  in the sun meanwhile just as mitsuri  cries as she can't take it anymore and  that it's killing her the hatred clone  and his attacks vanished letting her  know that tundra and the rest succeeded  and unlike with tangent mitsuri didn't  suffer any serious long-lasting injuries  like losing a limb against this higher  ranking upper moon fast forward to  chapter 182 and the team is taking on  muzon the strongest demon with yoshido's  help they succeeded in tricking muzon  into believing that mitsuri and igoro  were finished by taking control of  nakime's vision thus mitsuri catches  muzon off guard when she suddenly joins  the fight he's having against tanjong  gil unfortunately despite catching him  off guard mitsuri doesn't succeed in  harming the demon king of pop and she  claims she's never been so shocked  mitsuri is not stoic when it comes to  facing muzon although she is strong she  can't help but think of how scary muzon  is and how she's never seen a scarier  demon she feels like she's gonna die on  the spot she's so scared and wishes  gyome the strongest pillar would get  there soon against muzon you start to  see mitsuri lag behind the other  remaining hashira keep in mind shinobu  is dead by this time having sacrificed  her life to help stop upper moon 2 and  tangent is practically retired and not  fighting against muzon mitsurigiu and  iguro all attack him together when  yusuru finally manages to get everyone  outside of the infinity castle it's the  hardest fight of their lives no doubt as  even when they cut muzon he regenerates  the moment they cut him so if they slice  his neck the part they sliced first is  already healed by the time the sword  exits the other side muslin is crazy  strong but what can you expect from the  strongest demon between the three  fighting hashira mitsuri is the one that  looks like she'll be taken out first but  luckily gyomei arrives as she wished and  stops muzon's deadly attack the very  strong salami the wind hashira also  joins the battle at this point then once  more after muzon's attacks get even  faster mitsuri is the one who thinks  that she can't see him at all and is  relying on intuition and luck to dodge  she thinks to herself that she'll be the  first to fall even though she's barely  helped at all and although she obviously  did help her prediction of being the  first to fall is correct she's the first  one to get hit badly and gets a portion  of her face sliced off to igoro's horror  iguro takes her to safety and puts her  in good hands telling her that she's  done enough even though she wants to  keep fighting she begs igoro not to get  himself killed as tears rain down her  cheeks after mitsuri gets taken out  iguru turns his blade red and this leads  to a domino effect as gyomei sanemi and  giu's blades turn red as well red blades  like marks are associated with improved  offense and muzon's regeneration is  slowed down when a bright red blade is  used to cut him so unfortunately mitsuri  did not get to partake in these red  blade power ups after muzon is defeated  a very very injured iguro goes to  mitsuri who is on the verge of death  because of her injuries she no longer  feels any pain which is how she knows  she's dying while mitsuri thinks she  didn't help at all igoro insists that  her bottomless cheerfulness and kindness  saved many people including him and she  should be proud i love the fact that  saving people is put into a different  context here it doesn't just have to be  physically it could be emotionally too  and throughout the series mitsuri  evidently saved many people in both ways  we finally get their confessions of love  which i love to see mitsuri cries saying  she's so happy she says she cares about  igoro so much and that meals always  tasted best with him because he looked  at her with so much affection she begs  him if they were reborn as humans for  iguro to take her as his bride and of  course he agrees because that is what he  wanted all along you don't just go out  of your way to randomly give the girl  socks if you don't want to marry her in  this life or the next and they do get  their wish they are reincarnated in a  later life and get their happy ending  and it was one of my favorite parts of  the final chapter however that is a  topic for another video so back to the  question how strong exactly is mitsuri  the love pillar well very strong she is  a hashira because she excelled among  demon slayers her technique was even  faster than tengen's and that was before  she awakened the demon's layer mark  which made her even faster and stronger  while shinobu wasn't strong enough to  cut off a demon's head mitsuri was  exceptionally strong because of her  crazy muscle density she could not only  cut a demon's head off but survive  attacks that would have left most people  in shreds and while tengan was hurt  badly losing an arm and an eye by upper  moon 6 even after having helped from  tanjoy nosquezo and his wives mitsuri  was able to hold off upper moon 4's  insanely powerful hatred clone long  enough for tundra to take out the real  and much weaker body and she suffered no  lasting serious injuries obviously she  did eventually get defeated against  muzon the strongest demon and in that  fight she showed that she couldn't quite  keep up with geyu igura sanemi and gyome  so all in all as i explained in my  hashtag rank for week is the strongest  video link in the description i would  put mitsuri above shinobu and tangen but  below the other hashira still it must be  kept in mind that these hasha are an  especially strong batch of hashira and  as we discussed in the tangent video  tengen was stronger than the many  hashiragutaro fought and beat before  even if tengan was among the weaker  hashra of this insanely talented  generation and i always want to  emphasize in these videos that there is  much more to characters than just  strength as iguro did such a good job of  pointing out don't ever think i'm hating  on a character just because i rank them  lower in terms of strength because many  of my favorite characters are not the  strongest characters but that is it for  this one in the end mitsuri is not only  best girl but also the strongest female  hashira if you did enjoy this video and  want to keep the demonstrator videos  coming chill the orichi within and smash  that like button as mentioned if we can  get 4  500 likes i repeat 4 500 i'll get  started on my detailed breakdown on  shinobu and her abilities and overall  strength besides remember smashing that  like button is your ichi energy and  passing its muzon energy so choose  wisely if you haven't make this the  video you subscribe and this is crucial  hit that notification bell to turn on  all notifications or you will miss  future demon slayer videos that's just  the way it works and while you wait for  the next demonstration and video to come  out which will be very soon feel free to  check out my huge and growing  demonstrator playlist which includes  videos on every demon moon every hashira  every demon slayer and much much more  link to that is in the description and  until next time see ya space cowboys  [Music]  you
 

